('Mark van den Brand', 'Computer Science', 'Software Engineering and Technology', 'Software Engineering and Technology', true, 'Software quality, Domain Driven Design, Meta models, Digital Twins, model-driven software development, Legacy, AI-for-SE', 'Door sommigen de ''founding father'' van digital twin''s genoemd.

