('Ion Barosan', 'Computer Science', 'Software Engineering and Technology', 'Software Engineering and Technology', false, 'Visualization of systems, digital twins, UML, SysML, (AI-assisted SE for ) Automotive', '(Digital Twins for)/(AI-assisted SE for) Automative, model based engineering, AI4Automotive SE?'),
