('Yanja Dajsuren', 'Computer Science', 'Software Engineering and Technology', 'Software Engineering and Technology', false, 'Architecture frameworks/description langauges, MDE, compontent based SE, automous and cooperative mobility, synthetic data generation', '''Yanja''s research interests include software architecture description mechanisms (architecture frameworks, architecture description languages), model-driven development, component-based software engineering, and software quality. As an assistant professor, she works on the system/software architecture related topics of autonomous and cooperative driving vehicles as well as Cooperative Intelligent Transport Systems'''),
