('Loek Cleophas', 'Computer Science', 'Software Engineering and Technology', 'Engineering of Software-Intensive Systems', false, 'MDE, algorithmic engineering, DSL, DT, inter-model analysis', '''Correctness, efficiency, and elegance are core concerns in software engineering. They are often seen together-or not at all''

