('Alexander Serebrenik', 'Computer Science', 'Software Engineering and Technology', 'Social Software Engineering', true, 'Empiricism; digital tools (e.g. machine learning, DT''s of social interaction, NLP) for the sociology of software engineering.', 'Empiricism; socio-technical perspective (e.g. DT''s of social interactions, machine learning, NLP) in combination with sociology/psychology of SE ''proper''.
(for example currently: DT''s of social interactions) i.c.w. sociological/psychological.'),
